RewriteEngine On
RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^www\.unifostedu\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://unifostedu.com/$1 [L,R=301]


## University slug fixes
# /universities/jain-university-online/ -> /jain/
Redirect 301 /universities/jain-university-online/ https://unifostedu.com/jain/

## Courses broken slugs
# If m.com-online and b.com-online existed, send to /courses/
Redirect 301 /courses/m.com-online/ https://unifostedu.com/courses/
Redirect 301 /courses/b.com-online/ https://unifostedu.com/courses/

## Blog safe fallback
# If an old blog listing path exists, send to /search or homepage
Redirect 301 /blog/blog-page https://unifostedu.com/search/

